# Test-First Discipline

Treat every non-trivial change as test-first work.

**Hard requirement:** Any work that fixes a discovered defect or failure must also add or extend a regression test per `every-error-regression-test.mdc` (that rule takes precedence on “no test, no done”).

## Required workflow
- Before changing behavior, add or update the smallest relevant test that captures the intended behavior or reproduces the bug.
- Prefer seeing that test fail first for bug fixes and behavior changes; then implement code changes and make it pass.
- For refactors, lock existing behavior with tests before simplifying/moving code.
- If a true test-first sequence is blocked (for example missing fixture/runtime), document the blocker in the task and add regression coverage immediately after code changes.

## Scope expectations
- Apply this to backend, frontend, API contract, routing, ingestion/metrics, caching, and config/runtime changes.
- Select the narrowest test level that proves correctness first (unit/component); see **`testing-best-practices.mdc`** for the pyramid and pre-merge matrix.
- **New modules** (Python package files, React components, utils) require a **colocated test file** in the same task.
- Do not mark work complete without running the relevant tests for touched behavior.

## Integration with implementation workflow

- **`implementation-review-workflow.mdc`** — pre-code planning and post-code self-review; regression coverage and test runs are part of the post-implementation review.

## Integration with existing testing rules
- **`testing-best-practices.mdc`** — canonical pyramid, mock boundaries, drift guards, refactor-for-testability.
- Follow compose-network workflows for non-unit tests per `docker-compose-non-unit-testing.mdc` and `full-test-with-db-redis.mdc`.
- When web pages/routes change, also follow `web-pages-e2e-test-maintenance.mdc` and `pipeline-endpoint-matrix-drift-guard.mdc`.
- When ingest/metrics behavior changes, also follow `pipeline-metrics-e2e-maintenance.mdc` and `runtime-resource-and-metrics-safety.mdc`.
- When test workflows/scope/prereqs change, update `HPCPerfStats/docs/TESTING.md` per `testing-doc-sync.mdc`.
